# The first swing in the game that is HELD: an orb that zaps everything around
# it every 150ms for as long as the key is down, then bursts. Twelve pulses is
# a full two seconds; 960ms is the shortest it can be let go after, which five
# pulses and the burst fit inside.
#
# Fourteen enemies against GMS's fifteen, off a 500x400 sphere -- seven abreast
# over two storeys. See Skill.max_enemies.
#
# It picks its fourteen when the hold opens and never again, so the fight holds
# it only as long as the pulses still have somewhere to land -- against a boss
# that is the whole two seconds, and on a map it is the floor. See Channel.
#
# Lightning, so it spends the pile an ice swing left and hits harder for every
# stack it went in holding. GMS's line about attack reflection is dropped with
# the rest of what this game has no notion of.
name: "Lightning Orb"
skill_order: 2
description:
  "Creates a large, unstable sphere of electricity to continuously zap "
  "enemies."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
tags: SKILL_TAG_LIGHTNING
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_ICE_LIGHTNING_ARCH_MAGE
hyper: true
required_level: 160
max_level: 1
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_STAFF
base_delay_ms: 960
max_enemies: 14
lines: 15
cooldown_seconds: 60.0
base { skill_pct: 1.35 }
channel {
  pulse_interval_ms: 150
  max_pulses: 12
  finish_delay_ms: 200
  damage_taken_pct: 0.50
  finish {
    label: "Final Attack"
    lines: 15
    base { skill_pct: 7.02 }
  }
}
